1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,720
One little jeep. Nineteen people to rescue.
Four tanks stand in the way.

2
00:00:05,175 --> 00:00:07,032
Jackal: let us go!

3
00:00:08,536 --> 00:00:11,768
Blast open the barracks with a grenade, then
drive over to pick up prisoners.

4
00:00:12,223 --> 00:00:15,593
The back seat is getting crowded. This
rescue has to count.

5
00:00:17,106 --> 00:00:20,838
Flashing prisoners are the key upgrade. Pick
one up,

6
00:00:21,018 --> 00:00:24,239
and grenades become rockets. Now we have the
firepower.

7
00:00:25,748 --> 00:00:29,368
The camp gate can be destroyed too. Drive in
and rescue more people.

8
00:00:29,548 --> 00:00:32,805
Upgrade to two-way rockets, then four-way
rockets.

9
00:00:34,318 --> 00:00:37,751
Clear the tank guarding the bridge, then
pick up the flashing prisoner.

10
00:00:38,206 --> 00:00:40,838
Look at the upper left: four-way rockets
acquired.

11
00:00:40,968 --> 00:00:42,700
Rescuing people makes us stronger.

12
00:00:44,184 --> 00:00:48,742
Find the helipad, and stop to unload. The
passenger count goes down,

13
00:00:48,934 --> 00:00:52,217
the delivered count goes up. Nineteen
people: everyone made it.

14
00:00:53,738 --> 00:00:57,446
Four blue tanks are the final fight. Line up
before firing.

15
00:00:57,651 --> 00:01:02,221
If they get close, move sideways. Shell hits
really reduce the armor.

16
00:01:02,488 --> 00:01:04,008
Unlimited lives do not mean invincibility.

17
00:01:05,524 --> 00:01:10,444
The last tank is down. Stage one's rescue is
complete. Next stop: the ruined city.

18
00:01:15,524 --> 00:01:20,419
Stage two is the ruined city. Pillars,
narrow roads and crossfire

19
00:01:20,637 --> 00:01:22,357
make the route much tighter.

20
00:01:23,854 --> 00:01:28,162
I failed to dodge that hit. The jeep was
destroyed. Respawning lets us continue,

21
00:01:28,329 --> 00:01:31,287
but the weapon resets to grenades. Time to
rescue more people

22
00:01:31,429 --> 00:01:32,549
and rebuild our firepower.

23
00:01:34,056 --> 00:01:37,339
Back into camp to open the barracks. Pick up
a flashing prisoner,

24
00:01:37,493 --> 00:01:40,864
and upgrade the weapon again. There is a
repair pickup ahead.

25
00:01:41,131 --> 00:01:42,676
Lost armor can still be recovered.

26
00:01:44,186 --> 00:01:48,919
On this ruined-city run, all fifteen people
were delivered. Cross the stone bridge,

27
00:01:49,023 --> 00:01:50,081
and keep moving north.

28
00:01:51,580 --> 00:01:55,925
Stage two ends with four statues. Aim at
them and fire,

29
00:01:56,155 --> 00:01:59,863
while watching incoming missiles and tanks.
The last statue goes down.

30
00:02:00,118 --> 00:02:01,025
Both stages cleared!

31
00:02:06,580 --> 00:02:09,275
Use the direction keys to move. The machine
gun follows the jeep's facing,

32
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:12,338
and grenades go the same way. Press C in
this recorded build

33
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:14,275
to switch between overhead and close views.

34
00:02:15,798 --> 00:02:20,406
Rescues, upgrades and two stages now
connect.

35
00:02:20,848 --> 00:02:24,593
What would you improve first: steering, or
the feel of throwing grenades?

36
00:02:26,096 --> 00:02:28,666
This two-stage run was recorded on October
fourth.

37
00:02:29,121 --> 00:02:33,729
The current demo is linked below. Follow its
in-game controls.

38
00:02:34,171 --> 00:02:35,154
See you next time!
